  "description": "Clean cloth and a carefully spent water ration are modest tools against Arrakis. At a crafting spot, four cloth and one physical ration become four field dressings after 600 work. Arrakis Survival opens the recipe; tailoring benches can also prepare them.\n\nA doctor uses these through ordinary medical care. Potency is only 25%, and tend quality is capped at 35%, below desert medicinals. They are a fallback, not a guarantee against infection or a substitute for a trained clinician. Eligible operations still follow native medicine requirements and risks.",
